  message: "From WI-silos (branch jgstern-agent/fix/silos, commit 41fd9834a6, not yet merged): the deeper-chain half now carries CATALOGUED recall. WI-silos makes an untyped local shadow, so `let fileManager = config.fileManager` (Kingfisher Sources/Cache/DiskStorage.swift:122/250/397) no longer falls through to another type's `fileManager` property, and Kingfisher's io-boundaries lose fs_read FileManager.enumerator, fs_read FileManager.fileExists and fs_write FileManager.createDirectory (total_io_edges 63 -> 60, frozen-copy A/B). Typing `config.fileManager` needs exactly the member lookup this item describes: the head's type (implicit-self field `config: Config`), then Config.fileManager in the field-type registry. Sized with the other initialiser gaps on WI-hojib-tunuz-dabog-kunab-badib-humaj-mivuk-zumun."  # 2e78
